        "explanation": "$\\sqrt{4 + 1 + 4} = 3$; the unit vector is $\\left(\\frac{2}{3}, -\\frac{1}{3}, \\frac{2}{3}\\right)$."
      },
      {
        "mcqId": "M05-MCQ02",
        "stemLatex": "For $\\vec{a} = (1, 2, 3)$ and $\\vec{b} = (4, -2, 0)$, the vectors are:",
