    "memoryHooks": [
      "Dot = scalar $\\cos\\theta$; cross = vector $\\sin\\theta$.",
      "Projection divides by the ON vector: $\\frac{\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}}{|\\vec{b}|}$.",
      "Cross zero $\\to$ collinear; dot zero $\\to$ perpendicular.",
      "Half cross for triangle areas.",
      "Lagrange: cross² + dot² = product of squared lengths.",
      "Triple product = 3×3 determinant = signed volume.",
      "Cyclic shifts preserve; swapping two flips sign.",
      "Sum cycle doubles: $[a+b, b+c, c+a] = 2[a\\,b\\,c]$; difference cycle dies.",
      "BAC-CAB: $\\vec{a}\\times(\\vec{b}\\times\\vec{c}) = (\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{c})\\vec{b} - (\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b})\\vec{c}$.",
      "Vector triple product is NOT associative — brackets are law."
    ],
    "commonMistakes": [
      "Dividing the projection by $|\\vec{a}|$ instead of $|\\vec{b}|$.",
      "Treating $\\vec{a}\\times(\\vec{b}\\times\\vec{c})$ and $(\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b})\\times\\vec{c}$ as equal.",
      "Forgetting the triangle's $\\frac{1}{2}$ factor on the cross product.",
      "Using cyclic shifts on odd permutations (sign flips!).",
      "Quoting $[\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}, \\vec{b}-\\vec{c}, \\vec{c}-\\vec{a}] = 2[\\vec{a}\\;\\vec{b}\\;\\vec{c}]$ (it is $0$).",
      "Dropping the direction cosines' $l^2 + m^2 + n^2 = 1$ check.",
      "Sign errors in the $3\\times 3$ determinant expansion.",
      "Calling BAC-CAB 'BAC-CAB' and writing $(\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b})\\vec{c}$ first."
    ],
    "examChecklist": [
      "Compute magnitude + unit vector in one step.",
      "Verify $l^2 + m^2 + n^2 = 1$ on any direction-cosine answer.",
      "Use dot $= 0$ / cross $= 0$ as perpendicular/collinear tests.",
      "Divide projections by $|\\vec{b}|$.",
      "Parallelogram vs triangle: keep the $\\frac{1}{2}$ straight.",
      "Deploy Lagrange's identity when $\\theta$ is unknown.",
      "Coplanarity $\\iff$ triple product $= 0$.",
      "Know $[a+b, b+c, c+a] = 2[a\\,b\\,c]$ and the zero difference cycle.",
      "Expand vector triple products with BAC-CAB only.",
      "State non-associativity of the vector triple product when asked."
